abstract: >-
  Pre-trained neural network models (MLP and randomized
  architectures) for predicting thermal plume dimensions in
  groundwater from hydrogeological input parameters. Companion
  software for the bachelor thesis "Comparison of Neural Network
  Architectures on the Task of Modeling Heat Plume Dimensions in
  Groundwater".
